__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){Object.defineProperty(e,"__esModule",{value:!0}),e.MESSAGE_TEMPLATES=void 0,e.getMessageTemplateById=function(t){return n.find(n=>n.id===t)},e.getMessageTemplatesByCategory=function(t){return n.filter(n=>n.category===t)},e.getMessageTemplatesBySessionType=function(t){const s=o[t]??[];if(0===s.length)return[];return n.filter(t=>s.includes(t.category))};var t=r(d[0]);const n=e.MESSAGE_TEMPLATES=[{id:'0',createdAt:'2025-07-15',updatedAt:'2026-06-30',category:'Discovery',name:'Welcome Message',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**!\n\nWelcome to Fruitful! I'm really glad you're here and excited to meet you on **[GUIDANCE SESSION DATE]**.\n\nCome as you are! This first session is all about getting to know you, your goals, what's working (and what's not), and building a financial system that makes your goals actually possible - [Money Map](https://www.fruitful.com/post/what-is-a-money-map )\n\nTo best prepare for our first session, finish your profile in the app - I'll have a draft Money Map ready so we can dive right in.\n\nCan't wait to get started!"},{id:'5',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2026-03-04',category:'Discovery',name:'Discovery Follow Up',template:"Hey **[MEMBER_NAME]**!\n\nI really enjoyed our conversation today, thanks for sharing your story with me! Excited to keep building from where we left off.\n\nIn our next meeting, we'll **finalize your Money Map** (your personalized money system!) and finish setting everything up together so it's ready to run.\n\n**Quick reminders:**\n\n- You'll see a few to-dos in your [Tasks](https://my.fruitful.com/roadmap/tasks ). Pop over there and let me know if you have any questions.\n- When you have a moment, feel free to explore the [Cash & Card](https://www.fruitful.com/cash-and-card ) and [Investing](https://www.fruitful.com/invest ) features included in your membership to learn more about how this all works and all the perks!\n\nIf anything comes up before we meet again, just shoot me a message here!"},{id:'6',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'Money Map',name:'Money Map Missing Info Reminder 1',template:"Hey **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI'm looking forward to our next conversation and have already started prepping your Money Map! You have some outstanding tasks in your [Goals](https://my.fruitful.com/roadmap/tasks ) section that I'll need in order to prepare for our meeting. Could you please complete these by **[DEADLINE]**? That'll give me enough time to review everything and come prepared with insights.\n\nIf that timing's tough, no problem at all, just let me know or feel free to reschedule in the [Guidance tab](https://my.fruitful.com/home/my-guide ) of the member portal.\n\nExcited to keep things moving!"},{id:'7',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-11-12',category:'Money Map',name:'Money Map Follow Up',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**!\nIt was great chatting today \u2014 I'm excited for you to get your system up and running!\n\n**Your Money Map is now live!**\nHead to the [Money Map tab](https://my.fruitful.com/home/roadmap ) in your member dashboard to get started. Follow the quick prompts to open your accounts and set up your Income Split \u2014 it just takes a few minutes and puts your money system in motion.\nThis is the step that turns your plan into real momentum. Once your system is running, your money will automatically start flowing toward your goals \u2014 saving you time, mental energy, and decision fatigue.\n\nAnd you don't have to do it alone \u2014 we're here every step of the way:\n- Message me directly anytime for personalized guidance\n- Email **support@fruitful.com** for membership, billing, or technical banking questions\n- Or, if you need quick help getting your system set up (like moving a bill or updating direct deposit), **call us at (833) 789-2219** \u2014 someone from our team will answer or get back to you quickly\n\nCheck your [Goals & Tasks](https://my.fruitful.com/roadmap/tasks ) section for any final setup items we didn't want to forget! There are a few tips and tricks I added to make the transition to the new money system run smoothly.\n\nLet me know if you hit any snags or just want to confirm you're on the right track! Let's do this!"},{id:'9',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'Investment Optimization',name:'Optimization Info Statements Reminder',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nHope you're doing well! To help me prepare for our upcoming Investment Optimization session, could you please send over your **[new/updated]** account statements? Having the most current info will help me tailor my recommendations to your full financial picture."},{id:'10',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2026-01-27',category:'Investment Optimization',name:'Optimization Follow Up',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI really enjoyed our conversation today! I've updated your Goals & Tasks section with the key takeaways and next steps we discussed, so you can revisit everything anytime [here](https://my.fruitful.com/roadmap/tasks ).\n\nThe goal of our Optimization meeting was to make sure your money is working smarter and staying aligned with where you're headed. Take your time reviewing, and if anything comes up, I'm just a message away.\n\nOne quick heads up: We just launched **Fruitful Referrals** \ud83c\udf89 If you have a friend who might benefit from Fruitful, you can invite them to join and you'll both receive $100 (up to five referrals per year).\n\n\u2192 my.fruitful.com/referrals\n\nLooking forward to our next check-in and keeping the momentum going!"},{id:'11',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'Check In',name:'Check In / Milestone Follow Up',template:"Hey **[MEMBER_NAME]**!\n\nIt was great catching up today! I'm excited about the progress you've made, and together we've built a solid foundation for your financial goals.\n\nRemember, your to-dos are in the [Goals & Tasks](https://my.fruitful.com/roadmap/tasks ) section of your member app. As you check them off, you'll keep that momentum going!\n\nThank you for sharing your feedback and insights today \u2014 we always love hearing from you! [Please click here to fill out your Member Survey](https://forms.gle/ASfBf4kuqTZi8kGM8? ). Your responses help our product, guidance, and engineering teams continue improving and expanding the membership experience.\n\nLooking forward to our next check-in! Feel free to message me anytime if you have questions or updates."},{id:'14',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-12',category:'General / Reminders',name:'No Show',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**, sorry I missed you today! Feel free to reschedule when you're ready in the [Guidance tab](https://my.fruitful.com/home/my-guide ). Let me know if you need anything else in the meantime!"},{id:'15',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-12',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Market Volatility Concerns',template:"I totally understand your concerns about market volatility \u2014 it's completely normal to feel uneasy when things are up and down. But remember, market cycles like this are part of the process, and historically, they've always balanced out over time. The key is sticking to the plan we've put in place, which is designed to weather these ups and downs and keep you on track toward your long-term goals.\n\nBy staying the course, you're setting yourself up for success, and reacting emotionally to short-term market shifts can sometimes derail that progress. If you ever want to talk through anything, I'm here!"},{id:'17',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'FAQ',name:'Security Questions',template:"We take security extremely seriously. We know you entrust us with your finances, and we take that responsibility personally. When you give us information, we make sure only the people you shared it with can see it, we encrypt it in transit and at rest, and we have best-in-class security practices in place to make sure bad actors can never get to it.\n\nWe do all the standard security things that you'd expect (multi-factor authentication, end-to-end encryption, regular third-party security assessments, continuous monitoring, employee training, etc.), but more importantly, security is just deeply ingrained into our culture. Our guides painstakingly safeguard your personal information, our banking team actively scans your account for suspicious activity, and our engineering team proactively defends against the latest cyber threats."},{id:'18',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'FAQ',name:"Extra Security Questions / Won't Link Accounts",template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**, thank you for sharing your concerns! These processes have been established to ensure efficiency and consistency across our operations. If you find that our approach doesn't align with your expectations, we completely respect your decision if you choose to look elsewhere for your financial wellness needs."},{id:'19',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2024-11-01',category:'FAQ',name:'Why Link Accounts',template:"For both you and your Guide, linking your accounts makes it really easy to stay up to date and accurate on your financial world. It means we don't have to manually track and update accounts consistently, creating one centralized reference so we can provide quicker, more informed answers and advice. It'll also be the foundation that powers helpful future feature releases that make navigating your finances even simpler."},{id:'20',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2024-11-01',category:'FAQ',name:'Update payment method',template:"You can update your payment method [via Stripe](https://billing.stripe.com/p/login/eVabLl0ExeXYbXa144 )"},{id:'21',createdAt:'2024-11-01',updatedAt:'2024-11-01',category:'FAQ',name:'Why Keep Membership Long Term',template:"Managing your money isn't a one-and-done task \u2014 it's an ongoing journey that evolves as your life changes. Your financial situation and even your goals will shift over time, and that's completely natural. Instead of starting from scratch with a new advisor every time life throws a curve ball or relying on generic advice from AI, Fruitful members have something better: access to a human expert who truly understands your unique situation.\n\nAt Fruitful, we believe in building a system that works for you automatically, adapting as your needs change. Whether it's adjusting your savings strategy, tweaking your Free to Spend account, or making sure your investments align with your goals, we're here to help you stay on track. While traditional financial advice hasn't always been built for everyone, one thing they got right is having someone in your corner for the long haul\u2014and at Fruitful, that's exactly what you get."},{id:'25',createdAt:'2025-07-15',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'Check In',name:'Pre-Check in prep',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\nWe have our Check-In meeting coming up on **[DAY]**. This is a great opportunity to reflect on the progress you've made, review any open action items, and discuss next steps. If there's anything specific you'd like to cover or any updates since our last meeting, feel free to let me know so I can be fully prepared.\n\nSee you soon!"},{id:'31',createdAt:'2025-04-04',updatedAt:'2026-02-23',category:'FAQ',name:'How does the Fruitful Card work?',template:"The Fruitful Card is a **secured charge card**, which means you can only spend the cash you already have in your Fruitful Cash Account.\n\nWhen you make a purchase, that money is automatically set aside (reserved) from your balance to cover your statement. It stays in your account earning 4% APY, but it's earmarked to pay the card.\n\nInstead of transactions clearing individually, purchases accumulate throughout the month. At the end of the billing cycle, one automatic payment pulls those reserved funds and pays the balance in full.\n\n**Here's what that means for you:**\n\u2022 Your cash keeps earning *4% APY* while purchases accumulate, until the auto-pay date.\n\u2022 Everything stays streamlined with one simple monthly payment.\n\u2022 You never carry a balance, never pay interest, and you're always spending money you already have.\n\u2022 You earn *2% cash back* across the board when you have at least $2,000 in direct deposits into one or more Fruitful Cash accounts in the prior month. If not, you'll still earn *1% cash back* on all spending.\n\nYou can learn more in [the Fruitful Card section of our FAQ](https://www.fruitful.com/cash-and-card#cc-faq-card )"},{id:'32',createdAt:'2025-04-04',updatedAt:'2025-07-15',category:'FAQ',name:'Account linking issues',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\nThanks for letting me know. I'm sure this is frustrating, but we've recently made some updates to our account linking experience to make it smoother and more reliable. If you're having any trouble reconnecting your accounts, here are a few things to try:\n\n- **Try reconnecting again**: Sometimes it just works the second or third time.\n- **Double-check your login**: Make sure you're using the right username and password.\n- **Look for any extra security steps**: You may be asked to enter a code from your phone or email, or may be required to take action in their portal to approve the connection.\n- **Search for your bank a little differently**: Some have multiple names (like \"Chase\" vs. \"JP Morgan Chase\"), or separate logins for different types of accounts.\n- **Wait a bit and try later**: Many institutions sometimes have temporary issues that clear up on their own.\n\nIf it's still not working, our Hospitality Team is ready to help. Send them an email at support@fruitful.com."},{id:'33',createdAt:'2025-10-16',updatedAt:'2025-10-16',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Waiting in the Zoom',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**, is now still a good time to chat? I'll stick around for another few minutes in case you're just running behind."},{id:'34',createdAt:'2025-10-16',updatedAt:'2025-10-16',category:'Membership',name:'Married, Signed Up Solo',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI noticed you listed that you're married filing jointly and wanted to share why adding your partner might be helpful.\n\nYou can actually add them for no extra cost, and I highly recommend it. Most couples manage at least some (if not all) of their finances together and share long-term goals, and from a guidance and compliance standpoint, I'm more limited in what I can advise on (especially around retirement) if your partner isn't included.\n\nIt's also important if we're building out your money system and need to set up any joint accounts, your partner will need to be listed on your membership in order to be added to those accounts.\n\nAnd honestly, this goes far beyond just convenience. So many parts of your financial life are connected... taxes, Social Security benefits, estate planning, life insurance coverage, employee benefits, and even how joint debt is managed. When I can see both sides of the picture, I can give advice that's more accurate, strategic, and truly personalized to your situation as a couple.\n\nWhen both voices are part of the plan, it makes everything easier and more effective. You'll move faster toward your goals, stay more aligned as a team, and get the full value of what your membership offers.\n\nIf you'd like to add them, all I need is their email address, and our Support team will take care of the rest."},{id:'35',createdAt:'2025-12-11',updatedAt:'2025-12-11',category:'Membership',name:'Membership Payment Reminder',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**, Quick reminder to make sure you've made your membership payment this week so we can continue working together. Our hospitality team reached out to you via email with more info!"},{id:'36',createdAt:'2025-12-15',updatedAt:'2025-12-15',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Jan Busy Season',template:"Hey **[MEMBER_NAME]**! Thanks so much for reaching out. Yes, this time of year is always especially busy for us with so many people setting New Year's money goals. My calendar is a bit tricky! Thanks for your patience!\n\nIn the meantime, is there anything I can help with over messaging? I'm happy to share advice async so you can get an answer sooner if it's time-sensitive."},{id:'37',createdAt:'2025-12-15',updatedAt:'2025-12-15',category:'Check In',name:'Check in Upcoming',template:"I saw you booked some time for next week \u2014 looking forward to connecting. Before we meet, could you share a bit about what you're hoping to cover? Any recent financial updates or specific questions on your mind?\n\nIf it's easier, we can also work through everything here in messaging. A lot of members prefer this at the end of the year since it's quick and flexible, and I'm happy to support you this way if that feels better for you. Just let me know what you prefer!"},{id:'38',createdAt:'2026-01-08',updatedAt:'2026-01-08',category:'FAQ',name:"Why didn't my goals get funded?",template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**\nYup that makes sense that your goals weren't funded yet. Think of your Money Map like a waterfall: a multi-tiered process where funds are allocated in a specific order. Bills and spending are treated as the first tier of the waterfall, ensuring they are funded first up until the monthly caps we've designated. Any remaining funds then \"spill over\" to goals, which are funded based on their priority. This process resets monthly.\n\nIt's important to keep in mind that money allocated for goals may not begin funding until your second paycheck or later in the month\u2014but that's by design. It's structured to protect your core needs first (bills + spend), then accelerate progress when there's extra income. Also note that any interest earned from the Fruitful accounts or the 2% cash back on spending on your Fruitful card will follow these same rules and automatically flow in this same order of priority. So this means your money is always working for you even quietly behind the scenes!"},{id:'39',createdAt:'2026-01-15',updatedAt:'2026-01-15',category:'Money Map',name:'Money Map Progress Check In',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI'd love to hear how things are coming along with your Money Map! Any updates or questions I can help with? You're so close to having everything in place! Think of this as a little accountability nudge to keep our momentum going and a quick check in to see if there's anything I can do to support you in the meantime.\n\nFor a limited-time, you may be eligible for a $250 bonus when you receive a qualifying direct deposit in your Fruitful Cash Account [see terms here](https://www.fruitful.com/legal/250-direct-deposit-promo ) to learn if you're eligible!\n\nAnd you don't have to do it alone - we're here every step of the way:\n\u2022 Message me directly anytime for personalized guidance\n\u2022 If you need quick help getting your system set up (like moving a bill or updating direct deposit), **call us at (833) 789-2219** \u2014 someone from our team will answer or get back to you quickly\n\u2022 Email **support@fruitful.com** for membership, billing, or technical banking questions"},{id:'40',createdAt:'2026-02-12',updatedAt:'2026-02-12',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Multiple Reschedules Template',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI noticed we've had to reschedule a few times - that happens. Let's pick back up our momentum!\n\nCome as you are to our next session \u2014 we'll use the time to keep things moving forward. Even if it's been a little while or things have shifted, meeting live gives us a chance to reset and get back on track.\n\nWe've all been there! I'm here and ready when you are. See you soon!"},{id:'41',createdAt:'2026-02-12',updatedAt:'2026-02-12',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Retrieving Tax Documents',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nHere are the steps to retrieve your tax documents. Let me know if you get stuck!\n\n**Fruitful Cash Accounts:**\nGo to the **Banking tab** on your homepage \u2192 **More\u2026** \u2192 **Statements and Docs** \u2192 **Taxes Tab**\n\n**Fruitful Investment Accounts:**\n1. Log in to your Fruitful member portal\n2. Select **Invest** on the Home page\n3. Click on an existing account, then select **View Account**\n4. In the left-hand menu, go to **Document Vault** \u2192 Apex Documents\n5. Select 2025 for the year, then click **Tax Statements**"},{id:'42',createdAt:'2026-02-18',updatedAt:'2026-02-18',category:'Membership',name:'Membership Change',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI know we've been covering a lot over messaging as you navigate these changes.\n\nIf it would be helpful, you always have the option to transition to our **Plus membership tier**, which gives you access to additional Zoom sessions. That could allow us to spend more dedicated time talking through these changes, adjusting your money map as needed, and making sure everything feels aligned as things evolve.\n\nThe goal would be to use the additional sessions with intention, **not as a default recurring check-in.**\n\nThe Plus tier is $148/month, and you can always move back to Essential once things feel steady again. It's designed to flex with different seasons of life offering more touchpoints when things are shifting, and a lighter cadence when everything is running smoothly.\n\nIf you'd like, I can have our Hospitality team help update this for you before your next billing cycle, just let me know!"},{id:'43',createdAt:'2026-02-23',updatedAt:'2026-02-23',category:'FAQ',name:'Add or Update Pin Number',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**\n\nTo set up or update your PIN, here are the steps:\n\n1. Navigate to the Banking section of your Fruitful portal\n2. Tap the account associated with your card (your spend account)\n3. Tap View Account\n4. Select your physical card\n5. Tap Change/Set up PIN"},{id:'44',createdAt:'2026-03-05',updatedAt:'2026-03-05',category:'General / Reminders',name:'Earlier Availability Reminder',template:"Hi [MEMBER_NAME]!\n\nI had some earlier availability open up and wanted to see if you'd like to meet sooner for our **[Discovery / Money Map]** session.\n\nYou can use [this link](https://my.fruitful.com/home/my-guide ) to see the current openings and reschedule. These spots sometimes get grabbed quickly, so go ahead and select a new time if you'd like to meet sooner!"},{id:'45',createdAt:'2026-04-02',updatedAt:'2026-04-02',category:'FAQ',name:'Lost or Stolen Card',template:"Hi **[MEMBER_NAME]**,\n\nI'm so sorry to hear this! You can lock your physical card in the app and request a replacement by following the steps below.\n\n**Steps to lock your card:**\n\n1. Go to your **Spend account**\n2. Tap **View account** and go to the section that shows your cards\n3. Select **your Physical card**\n4. Toggle **Lock card**\n\n**Steps to order a new card:**\n\nIn that same section, tap **Request a replacement card** and follow the prompts. Our Hospitality team will take it from there. Your new card typically arrives within 2\u20133 business days.\n\nWhile you're waiting for your new card to arrive, you can continue spending using your **virtual card**, which has a different card number.\n\nIf you notice any unfamiliar transactions, please let us know right away or reach out to our Hospitality team at **support@fruitful.com**"},{id:'46',createdAt:'2026-04-23',updatedAt:'2026-04-23',category:'FAQ',name:'Card Balance and Autopay',template:"No worries\u2014this is an easy fix.\n\nIt sounds like autopay isn't turned on yet. For now, you'll just need to manually release this payment. Going forward, you can turn on autopay so it happens automatically each cycle.\n\nA quick refresher on how the Fruitful Card works:\n\nThe Fruitful Card is a **secured charge card**, which means you can only spend money you already have in your Fruitful Cash Account.\n\nWhen you make a purchase, that amount is automatically set aside (reserved) from your balance to cover your statement. It stays in your account earning 4% APY, but it's earmarked for your card payment.\n\nInstead of transactions clearing one by one, purchases build up over the billing cycle. At the end, a single payment pulls from those reserved funds and pays the balance in full.\n\nSo in this case: the money is already set aside. You just need to manually trigger the payment this time\u2014it won't reduce your available balance since those funds are already reserved. Then you can turn on autopay so this happens automatically going forward.\n\nLet me know if anything's unclear. You can also call the helpline at **(833) 789-2219**\u2014someone from our team will be happy to help."},{id:'47',createdAt:'2026-06-08',updatedAt:'2026-06-08',category:'FAQ',name:'Direct Deposit Account Verification',template:"You can download a Direct Deposit Account Verification letter easily through your Fruitful App that should allow your employer to get your direct deposit switched over to one of your Fruitful Accounts.\n\n1. Navigate to the Banking tab within your Fruitful app\n2. Select 'More'\n3. Select 'Set up direct deposit'\n4. Select 'Switch manually'\n5. Select 'Download letter' link located directly above the 'Done' button\n6. Select the Account you would like your direct deposit to be directed to\n7. Click 'Download account verification letter'\n\nLet me know if you have any questions or run into any issues."},{id:'48',createdAt:'2026-06-08',updatedAt:'2026-06-08',category:'FAQ',name:'Account Verification Letter',template:"You can download an Account Verification letter that should allow your bill provider to get your bill pay switched over to one of your Fruitful accounts.\n\n1. Head to the **Switch your bills** section of your Money Map set up\n2. Under the Fruitful Card, click **Download** letter\n3. Select the Account you would like your direct deposit to be directed to\n4. Click **Download account verification letter**\n\nLet me know if you have any questions or run into any issues."}],o={[t.GuidanceSessionType.DISCOVERY]:['Discovery'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.ROADMAP]:['Money Map'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.BUILDING_WEALTH]:['Investment Optimization'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.QUICK_CHECK_IN]:['Check In'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.MEMBER_CALL]:['Check In'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.WELCOME_CALL]:[],[t.GuidanceSessionType.FREE_INTRO_SESSION]:[],[t.GuidanceSessionType.INVESTMENT_MANAGEMENT]:['Investment Optimization'],[t.GuidanceSessionType.REVIEW_CAPSTONE]:['Check In']}},5529,[3293]);
